desc:
• Concrete high-rise condo building; 
• South-facing 1 bedroom + 1 enclosed den, 651 sq ft, on the 6th floor; 
• Within walking distance to Gilmore SkyTrain Station in Burnaby. On Dawson between Willingdon and Gilmore; 
• In the neighborhood are Starbucks, Quiznos, Earl's, Day & Night etc.; 
• Near BCIT, SFU, Burnaby General Hospital, Brentwood Mall, Metrotown. Skytrain about 15 min to/from Downtown Vancouver. 

FEATURES: 

• Laminate flooring;
• Large 117 sq ft south-facing balcony;
• One full bathroom; 
• In-suite laundry washer and dryer; 
• Whirlpool stainless appliances (electric smoothtop cooking range, microwave oven, refrigerator with freezer and dishwasher) with granite counter top; 
• 9-foot ceiling; 
• Electric fireplace in living room; 
• 1 secure underground parking space and 1 storage locker;
• Unfurnished.

BONUS AMENITIES: 

• Exercise room; 
• Swimming pool with jacuzzi, steam room, sauna room; 
• Lounge room; 
• Building manager services. 

FOR RENT:

• Utilities are not included. 
• No pets. No Smoking. No marijuana. No subletting. No business or illegal activities. No installation on or in walls, windows or ceiling without the landlords' prior permission. Keep clean and quiet. Comply with strata by-laws and rules.
• Tenant credit check and references required. 
• Tenant shall pay strata move-in charge as per the strata requirement.
• Tenants are required to purchase their own insurance.
• Please email to introduce yourself and any co-occupant.
